{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into the driver's seat of your rocket-powered big rig as you haul cargo, scavenge for salvage and interact with an eclectic cast of star-hopping truckers in this Americana-infused journey on the ultimate open road - space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/80ec00e2a308abbcca11995d8b37e60d.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, this is Monster and Monster. Star Trucker is our tiny indie team's passion project, and we\u2019re committed to making it the best intergalactic trucking game we can. By listening to the community, we\u2019re working hard to improve the experience with every update. So buckle up and join us for the long haul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/b875f73e4c652c951a7473ca4b018899.poster.avif?t=1769517827\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/b875f73e4c652c951a7473ca4b018899.webm?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/b875f73e4c652c951a7473ca4b018899.mp4?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/b3b74c37a1b2e442ec1f4c2619f7d919.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your truck is not a starship. We\u2019ve taken typical vehicular controls then made sure zero-g momentum played a big part in maneuvers. The result is a unique driving experience that\u2019s easy to pick up yet hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/94fe85d5508d4ba24e465b99234a2638.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1560 height=253 /></span>Cruise the hyper highways, taking on a variety of jobs such as fuel hungry long hauls and hazardous drop-offs to earn cash and unlock new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>And don't forget to monitor the CB radio for chatter from fellow truckers; it's a fantastic way to uncover side gigs and stay updated on galactic gossip. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/1e1ac4a21f0d16b2a78338ed21fa5855.poster.avif?t=1769517827\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/1e1ac4a21f0d16b2a78338ed21fa5855.webm?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/1e1ac4a21f0d16b2a78338ed21fa5855.mp4?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/3f6a160d26ecc5d5a8c218e3354d2c36.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keeping your rig runnin\u2019 isn\u2019t always easy. You\u2019ll need to keep your core systems online, gravity compensator spinnin\u2019 and hull patched to prevent your cab from leaking lung juice.<br> <br>Be sure to make pre-trip shop stops for replacement parts, and consider upgrading your truck at a local garage. These improvements are vital for safely navigating volatile sectors and ensuring timely deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/25119f0fe113e5bda7e82de710401270.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the galactic map to plan your journey and warp jumps, while keeping an eye on your fuel reserves and power levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your route is set, kick back, crank up the cab hi-fi and cruise to a selection of original songs covering starburst blues, galactic rock and asteroid infused americana. The open road is waiting! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/c7cfd82d7137f3062c5234b10d116d3f.poster.avif?t=1769517827\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/c7cfd82d7137f3062c5234b10d116d3f.webm?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/c7cfd82d7137f3062c5234b10d116d3f.mp4?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Space Duster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2380050/03ac6bebb112ec2fdc9d5543a390ec9bc0e8d410.jpg"},{"name":"Hyper Hauler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2380050/8775627aa95da95dc4f23013d778132dd54deb90.jpg"},{"name":"Master Mover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2380050/9b0c36384e38d1ec67c554692acf9f78f01775da.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Hauler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2380050/2f9eff6ddff55b43054e460b20cc4da04731d5b4.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Hauler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2380050/3f7d52b3e3f0b9bc8251e72d7d99200b43c93f51.jpg"},{"name":"Master Hauler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2380050/fcc1db35723a1885f33010710280ac07196c24e9.jpg"},{"name":"Transit Trader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2380050/6ded6d3d01170e61e03ab00ab96f8fba793bc1a1.jpg"},{"name":"Moon Merchant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2380050/b9b1024bebed6bcb661645f4aa3ba0163efd6a76.jpg"},{"name":"Space Hustler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2380050/bdeae7efc1040699a1c0bf7cd780f01cf6732e15.jpg"},{"name":"No Sleep Till Vexmont","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2380050/6614c58fd4534e03ce3732c66078cd1acb060bad.jpg"}],"total":49},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2380050?t=1769517827","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769517827","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769517827","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769517827","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"In general the game does not contain scary, gory or foul language however as a player you do handle alchohol and narcotics. You dont consume it but you can bring it onboard and smuggle it. \r\n \r\nPlayer can also die on higher difficulties, usually due to lack of oxygen, heat and/or cold but the vision just fades to black when this occurs. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/6c8cae12ac0fdc243d16e79a09c3fff8.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1280 height=1054 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into the driver's seat of your rocket-powered big rig as you haul cargo, scavenge for salvage and interact with an eclectic cast of star-hopping truckers in this Americana-infused journey on the ultimate open road - space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/80ec00e2a308abbcca11995d8b37e60d.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, this is Monster and Monster. Star Trucker is our tiny indie team's passion project, and we\u2019re committed to making it the best intergalactic trucking game we can. By listening to the community, we\u2019re working hard to improve the experience with every update. So buckle up and join us for the long haul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/b875f73e4c652c951a7473ca4b018899.poster.avif?t=1769517827\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/b875f73e4c652c951a7473ca4b018899.webm?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/b875f73e4c652c951a7473ca4b018899.mp4?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/b3b74c37a1b2e442ec1f4c2619f7d919.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your truck is not a starship. We\u2019ve taken typical vehicular controls then made sure zero-g momentum played a big part in maneuvers. The result is a unique driving experience that\u2019s easy to pick up yet hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/94fe85d5508d4ba24e465b99234a2638.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1560 height=253 /></span>Cruise the hyper highways, taking on a variety of jobs such as fuel hungry long hauls and hazardous drop-offs to earn cash and unlock new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>And don't forget to monitor the CB radio for chatter from fellow truckers; it's a fantastic way to uncover side gigs and stay updated on galactic gossip. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/1e1ac4a21f0d16b2a78338ed21fa5855.poster.avif?t=1769517827\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/1e1ac4a21f0d16b2a78338ed21fa5855.webm?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/1e1ac4a21f0d16b2a78338ed21fa5855.mp4?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/3f6a160d26ecc5d5a8c218e3354d2c36.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keeping your rig runnin\u2019 isn\u2019t always easy. You\u2019ll need to keep your core systems online, gravity compensator spinnin\u2019 and hull patched to prevent your cab from leaking lung juice.<br> <br>Be sure to make pre-trip shop stops for replacement parts, and consider upgrading your truck at a local garage. These improvements are vital for safely navigating volatile sectors and ensuring timely deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/25119f0fe113e5bda7e82de710401270.avif?t=1769517827\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the galactic map to plan your journey and warp jumps, while keeping an eye on your fuel reserves and power levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your route is set, kick back, crank up the cab hi-fi and cruise to a selection of original songs covering starburst blues, galactic rock and asteroid infused americana. The open road is waiting! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/c7cfd82d7137f3062c5234b10d116d3f.poster.avif?t=1769517827\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/c7cfd82d7137f3062c5234b10d116d3f.webm?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380050/extras/c7cfd82d7137f3062c5234b10d116d3f.mp4?t=1769517827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Monster and Monster"],"dlc":[393320